{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act40side_level_act40side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act40side",
  "stageId": "act40side_07",
  "title": "Meaty Platter",
  "storyCode": "OR-7",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bf4b9cf0b989a074bbb4f1662cbfc00baaa167d858e665cae1b6ad63a758b390",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Incoherent Voice",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fire! FIRE!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Incoherent Voice",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Assassins! Protect His Majesty!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Incoherent Voice",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Guards, guards—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patrolling Guardsman",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Put out that fire! Lock the dining area down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Take care—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The source of this fire..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everyone! Stay away from the wine in the cups!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(A fire that does not burn hot...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Who did this... and what are they up to?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lin Qingyan tries to calm down the panicking crowd, but her voice is quickly drowned out by the shouting and screaming.\nIn the midst of the chaos, she spots a familiar face."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their eyes met for only a moment, but she is more sure than anything.\nThat person saw her, saw her attempt to cross the line of propriety in front of all.\nBut the target is not her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Blaze...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mo Bufu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's going on? What's with all this ruckus?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Veteran Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is bad! I heard some kind of demonic fire broke out at the banquet! No idea how it happened!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Veteran Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The guards have the dining area surrounded. No idea what's going on inside, or if His Majesty is hurt..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Veteran Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They're talking about... cutting the Feast short..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mo Bufu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lin Qingyan...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We've been notified of unknown persons infiltrating the Feast. We will now be conducting an inspection."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I ask that everyone stay where they are and not move. Please cooperate."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Dammit... What the hell happened over where Leizi is?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(This is bad. I can't leave her to fend for herself. I need to go take a look...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You there! Stop moving!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(What do I do what do I do? I can't get in a fight here!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(No time to think, dammit!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "After her!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard Chief",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "First Battalion, Fifth Battalion, seal off the southern entrance! Seventh and Ninth, close the northern gate!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard Chief",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everyone else, sweep the palace from south to north. If you find anyone suspicious, arrest them immediately."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard Chief",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Our intel says there are at least two culprits working together to ruin the Feast, so take care!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So many guards... What a pain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What kinda trouble did you manage to get yourself into here, Leizi?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sounds like you haven't gotten caught yet, at least... So where the hell are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tsch... This palace is way too big..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why're <i>you</i> here?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shh—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I thought you two just wanted to ask His Majesty to reopen the case? How did it come to this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't know either! That fire's not our doing!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But the timing..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You need to leave, right away! There's no talking your way out of it if they find you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What I <i>need</i> to do is save Lin Qingyan!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Let me go look for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How can I ask you to do something that dangerous?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm more familiar with the Forbidden City than you are. Even If I did get caught, I'll have some leeway to explain myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't worry. I'll find her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You still don't trust me. What, still angry at me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course not—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Head to the southern exit, before the guards seal it off!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We'll meet up at that restaurant once we're all out of here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You take care too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait, did the soldiers manage to get a good look at you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Err... Yeah, I think so."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's... not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, I know! Let's swap clothes. Come on, get them off."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Patrolling Soldier",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I saw someone running away up ahead! Over there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*Sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The dining area's been cleared out... Deputy Minister Lin wouldn't be here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But who started all this at the Feast..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I hope Blaze managed to make it out by now—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why is she here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "These two..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is this fate at work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Looks like it's not too far away now..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wonder how things are going over on their side..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Found you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who's there?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So it was you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Damn... That's one hell of a sword!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're not dressed like your average soldier. What are you, a general?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Save the chatter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So you're the one Lin Qingyan has been hiding behind her back... But why would she bring you to the Forbidden City?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Err... So I know it's impolite to barge in on someone else's banquet, but would you believe me if I said we didn't mean anything bad by it...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What I'm trying to say is that this is all a misunderstanding..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There is no misunderstanding here. The Imperial Guard have been searching for you for forty years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You are her descendant."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you talking about? Whose descendant? Who's 'her'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You really don't know—\nNo. It seems you're not lying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All this time you've been hidden away, and nobody thought to tell you about your history?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Haha, got me there... I'm pretty curious about it, not gonna lie. Anyone I can ask about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But seriously, the Imperial Guard? Looking for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Forty years ago, only a single child was unaccounted for in the family of a treasonous mandarin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You... What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Blaze... I need to confirm something..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You were born in 1062, in Victoria, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes. From as far back as I can remember, I lived in Victoria."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your father seemed to have been spending a lot of time pursuing a certain 'truth' in the last few years of his life."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What if... you found out everything around you was one big lie..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wha...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Y—You're talking nonsense! <i>Bi zui!</i>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You are a person of interest. We'll figure out what to do with you after questioning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Forget that!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Gah—!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're no weakling, it seems. I might not be able to take you in without hurting you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you don't wish to be harmed, then surrender immediately."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not in the mood for jokes right now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Panting heavily)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Didn't I tell you... to save yourself if... something happened...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Lin Qingyan."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lin Qingyan's eyes meet Blaze's.\nShe understands what has happened, but all she has to offer is silence.\nShe turns and stands in front of Blaze, shielding her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your deeds at the Judicial Review Office are worthy of my respect, Deputy Minister Lin. And I was kind enough to remind you before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It seems you have decided to completely ignore my warning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I am perfectly aware what I'm doing. I don't need your reminders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You know who she really is. Yet to go so far as to protect the descendant of a traitorous mandarin..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "For the truth. The truth you are all too afraid to talk about."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lin Qingyan!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you two talking about...? What do you mean... I'm the descendant of a traitor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My dad... Who is he? Why did he die...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Forgive me. I was planning to tell you everything after tonight. But it seems now is not a good time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I will make it up to you later however you like. Provided we make it out of here alive, that is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She will be coming with me tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As long as I am here, she will not."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Junior Drillmaster",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Forget that. You will need <i>three</i> of you to simply obstruct me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lin Qingyan!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Qingyan",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Go already!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A burst of lightning blasts open a hole in the palace wall. Before the dust has even settled, a somewhat gentler blast of energy strikes Blaze.\nShe is sent flying out of the Forbidden City, falling towards a distant patch of ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Blaze has done these sort of high-altitude leaps countless times before as a form of dynamic entry into the battlefield, or wherever happened to need her.\nShe has never once felt fear. She believed in her own strength, and in her many friends.\nThere was never any confusion in her mind either. She knew who she was. She knew where she must go. She knew what she believed in.\nThere is no plot that can hold back her heat, just like how the mist of dawn cannot hide away the sun.\nBut now?\nWhat awaits her is no longer solid ground, but an endless abyss.\nShe closes her eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Shu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Yin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ning Yin lies on the bed, her breathing faint.\nThe crutch in the old man's hand shudders, and he nearly falls over.\nAfter having seen so many things across so many years, he thought nothing more in this world could shock him.\nHis lips open and close, yet try as he might, he can make no sound.\nUntil someone in the shadows begins to speak first."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She yet lives."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Shu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's you—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stay your steps, Mr. Ning. Come no closer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You never saw me tonight, and she never left the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Shu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She... But why...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She intruded upon the Feast of a Hundred Delicacies. She was with that girl when I discovered her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If she had run into anyone else, she would not still be alive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Shu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Impossible..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Shu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Forty years... I can't believe it's you again..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Shu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Forty years ago, you left her here. Now, you save her life once more, save her from a terrible fate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Shu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fate... This must be fate..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Shu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's no escaping it. There never was."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I did not leave her here for her sake. It was you who saved her, Mr. Ning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You once swore an oath to never let anyone know the truth of this case in exchange for her name. But it seems you are now wavering when it comes to past vows."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Shu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The True Lung will know of tonight's events."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The choice is yours, Mr. Ning."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A gust of wind, and it was like nobody was even there.\nThe old man stands in stunned silence.\nHis daze is interrupted as he hears a sound coming from outside the courtyard walls.\nA sound like roaring, like weeping, like admonishment."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Shu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I must be going mad..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ning Shu",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's autumn. Why do I hear cicadas...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ah—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where... How did I get here?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, finally awake I see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I knew you were one tough Feline. Look at you, as lively as a fin on a line."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Jiang was making a fuss about calling a doctor. He was shouting so hard he forgot what time it was."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How long was I out... Wait, where are they?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lin Qingyan... Did Ning Yin come by here? I... Seriously, how did I get here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, slow down. I don't even know where to start with all these questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Last night I was on my way to the night market to get some cheap veggies when I found you lying down in the middle of the street. Thought you were drunk at first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I was worried you'd freeze to death or something, so I brought you back here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You were cursing up a storm in your sleep, hypocrite this, swindler that, and a lot more besides... Tsk, I don't know where you managed to learn such creative Yanese."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Ning Yin you mentioned, and whoever this Lin Qingyan is... Never seen them before, so I dunno if they were here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I need to go find them—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whoa, whoa, where're you going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Forbidden City."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I just saw a whole bunch of guards patrolling around there. You think you can still get in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't care. I have to go—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who d'you think you're going to find, after having lost yourself like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You... What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just speaking the truth here. You lost yourself, yeah?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't know where your self has gone, where it's wandered off to. You hear a few words from someone else and wouldn't you know it, you barely even know your own name, much less who you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Such absurdity..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A tangerine seed is blown from Jiangnan to Jiangbei, where it takes root and yields fine fruit. What let this seed grow so well wasn't Jiangnan <i>or</i> Jiangbei, but decades worth of rain and sun."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's ultimately the same fruit. Jiangnan and Jiangbei might not be the same place, but an orange is an orange. Doesn't matter where you eat it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All things begin, all things end. There is the outer truth, and the inner truth. Once you figure that out, then you can get back to asking your questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You... Do you know something about all this? What do you know?! Tell me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What do I know? I'm a chef, all I know is how to season my ingredients, how to boil stuff, stir-fry stuff, regular fry stuff—\nOh, right. Seeing you reminded me of something."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Weren't you trying to find authentic tangerine cakes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Chef",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I think I know how to make those."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
